{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["<b>A servant of servants shall he be to his brethren.</b> For being a servant to his brethren was fitting for him by nature, since he was inferior in rank and despised above all, as it says: וְעֶבֶד אֱוִיל לַחֲכַם לֵב (Proverbs 11:29). Therefore, for his sin, it was added that he would be a servant of servants."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:29:38.203701374Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}